{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"131"},{"key":"source_ocr_blocks","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>152</span></div>"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"原书OCR文本陈述已逐项比对；证明核验范围见Remark"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=(F,\\mathrm{ar})\">\\(\\Sigma=(F,\\mathrm{ar})\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)\">\\(T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)\\)</span> 和规则集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TRS}(\\Sigma,V,R)\">\\(\\mathrm{TRS}(\\Sigma,V,R)\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"a6c29a8d098ef0ed\" href=\"?note=a6c29a8d098ef0ed\" title=\"56-df-rewrite-system\">56-df-rewrite-system</a>；这里 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F,V\">\\(F,V\\)</span> 分别实例化上游的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F,\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal F,\\mathcal V\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\to_R\">\\(\\to_R\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"55c39f44acb2211c\" href=\"?note=55c39f44acb2211c\" title=\"56-df-rewrite-relation\">56-df-rewrite-relation</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Orthogonal}(\\Sigma,V,R)\">\\(\\mathrm{Orthogonal}(\\Sigma,V,R)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t,u\\in T\">\\(t,u\\in T\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\prec\">\\(\\prec\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;_{\\mathrm{lex}}\">\\(&lt;_{\\mathrm{lex}}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"da02033e6d596cae\" href=\"?note=da02033e6d596cae\" title=\"56-df-position\">56-df-position</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RedexPos}_R(t)\">\\(\\mathrm{RedexPos}_R(t)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"a3b60e1e9cdeef27\" href=\"?note=a3b60e1e9cdeef27\" title=\"56-df-rewrite-step\">56-df-rewrite-step</a>，位置替换接口见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"2ebc9e1638fe6861\" href=\"?note=2ebc9e1638fe6861\" title=\"56-df-normal-order\">56-df-normal-order</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{InnerPos}(\\Sigma,V,R,t):=\n\\{p\\in\\mathrm{RedexPos}_R(t):\n\\neg\\exists q\\in\\mathrm{RedexPos}_R(t)\\;(p\\prec q)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{InnerPos}(\\Sigma,V,R,t):=\n\\{p\\in\\mathrm{RedexPos}_R(t):\n\\neg\\exists q\\in\\mathrm{RedexPos}_R(t)\\;(p\\prec q)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{AI}_{\\Sigma,V,R}:={}&amp;\\{(t,t):t\\in T\\land\\mathrm{NF}(T,\\to_R,t)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{(t,t[r\\sigma]_p):t\\in T,\\;(l,r)\\in R,\\;\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sub}(\\Sigma,V),\\;\np\\in\\mathrm{InnerPos}(\\Sigma,V,R,t),\\;t|_p=l\\sigma,\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{40mm}\\neg\\exists q\\in\\mathrm{InnerPos}(\\Sigma,V,R,t)\\;(q&lt;_{\\mathrm{lex}}p)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{AI}_{\\Sigma,V,R}:={}&amp;\\{(t,t):t\\in T\\land\\mathrm{NF}(T,\\to_R,t)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{(t,t[r\\sigma]_p):t\\in T,\\;(l,r)\\in R,\\;\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sub}(\\Sigma,V),\\;\np\\in\\mathrm{InnerPos}(\\Sigma,V,R,t),\\;t|_p=l\\sigma,\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{40mm}\\neg\\exists q\\in\\mathrm{InnerPos}(\\Sigma,V,R,t)\\;(q&lt;_{\\mathrm{lex}}p)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AI}_{\\Sigma,V,R}:T\\to T.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{AI}_{\\Sigma,V,R}:T\\to T.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>最内红项的严格子位置没有红项；在其中取前序最小者。与最左最外相同，有限项和正交性保证图为全函数。最左最内通常不能保证找到已有正规形；本原子没有增加这种断言。</p>\n<p>来源定位中的 <code>source_ocr_blocks</code> 指本地提取文本的页块序号，不宣称是DjVu物理页码；印刷页已按该页页眉或页脚核对。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-normal-order","status":"resolved","id":"2ebc9e1638fe6861","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-normal-order]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-position","status":"resolved","id":"da02033e6d596cae","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-position]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-rewrite-step","status":"resolved","id":"a3b60e1e9cdeef27","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-rewrite-step]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-rewrite-system","status":"resolved","id":"a6c29a8d098ef0ed","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-rewrite-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-rewrite-relation","status":"resolved","id":"55c39f44acb2211c","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-rewrite-relation]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-rewrite-system","status":"resolved","id":"a6c29a8d098ef0ed","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma=(F,\\mathrm{ar})$、$V$、$T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)$ 和规则集 $R$ 满足 $\\mathrm{TRS}(\\Sigma,V,R)$，见 [[56-df-rewrite-system]]；这里 $F,V$ 分别实例化上游的 $\\mathcal F,\\mathcal V$；$\\to_R$ 见 [[56-df-rewrite-relation]]。","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-rewrite-relation","status":"resolved","id":"55c39f44acb2211c","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\S